Error [jet.DuplicateErrorConversion]: Duplicate error conversion: `impl AppErr.From(ParseErr)` is already declared
  --> tests/ui/e2405_dup_error_conv.jet:12:13
    |
 12 | impl AppErr.From(ParseErr) { from: fn(error: ParseErr) -> AppErr { AppErr.Parse(error) } }
